      <p>While both conditions show similar fat buildup under a microscope, their prevention and treatment strategies differ. A qualified liver specialist in Kanpur can perform the necessary assessments to distinguish between metabolic and alcohol-related factors, ensuring a tailored and effective management plan.</p>

