      <p>There is currently no single FDA-approved "magic pill" that cures fatty liver. Instead, evidence-based fatty liver treatment in Kanpur focuses on addressing the root metabolic causes, managing risk factors, and implementing targeted lifestyle modifications under medical guidance:</p>
      
