        <li><strong>ERCP:</strong> The only procedure that combines diagnostic imaging with immediate therapeutic intervention. If an MRCP or EUS confirms a stone or blockage, an ERCP is performed as the <strong>ERCP treatment</strong> to resolve the problem.</li>
