      <p>Managing stress directly helps calm gut nerves. Regular physical exercise, yoga, deep breathing exercises, mindfulness meditation, and cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT) have been shown to reduce the severity and frequency of IBS flare-ups.</p>
      
