      <p><strong>Q3: How often should I check my LFT?</strong><br/>
      If you have no symptoms or risk factors, routine LFTs are usually done during annual health check-ups. However, if you have chronic diabetes, obesity, drink alcohol, or take medications that affect the liver, your doctor may recommend checking your LFT every 3 to 6 months.</p>
      
