      <p><strong>Q5: What foods should I avoid when I have jaundice?</strong><br/>
      When your liver is inflamed, avoid foods that put a strain on it. This includes alcohol, deep-fried foods, oily gravies, highly spiced dishes, and processed foods. Focus on a light, easily digestible diet with plenty of fluids, fresh fruits, and cooked vegetables.</p>

