      <p>For patients dealing with suspected IBD, chronic right-sided abdominal pain, or complex perianal fistulas in Kanpur, <strong>Dr. Vikas Sengar</strong> provides expert diagnostic evaluation and clinical care at <strong>Medi Help Hospital</strong>, Sarvodaya Nagar, Kanpur.</p>
